{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hexalith</strong> is a strategic sci-fi city-builder where you expand a glowing hex-grid colony by placing resource and city tiles. Plan your layout, complete missions, and aim for the highest score where each run offers a new path to optimize and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f1957b105f4c13a28ce5ff940828b39e.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=600 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f1957b105f4c13a28ce5ff940828b39e.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f1957b105f4c13a28ce5ff940828b39e.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start With Choosing Your First City Blueprint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the beginning of every run, you choose one of three carriers and blueprints associated with them, which will help you get started (each carrier has different resource multiplier).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/e2f43161de0e3df7ef3bdf7764c4a700.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/e2f43161de0e3df7ef3bdf7764c4a700.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/e2f43161de0e3df7ef3bdf7764c4a700.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pay attention to the simulation point goal of missions because each blueprint grants different simulation points and costs different amounts of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Place Resources, Build Cities, Complete Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expand your colony using resource tiles, gradually unlocking the ability to place city-tiles. Cities generate Simulation - Sim Points, helping you fulfill main and bonus missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/a2514bdb202f655b7a1bd5bba50ff491.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=480 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/a2514bdb202f655b7a1bd5bba50ff491.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/a2514bdb202f655b7a1bd5bba50ff491.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Smart tile placement matters. There are 11 unique city-tiles currently in the game, but you can hold at most 8 at one point, each with their own adjacency effects that reward thoughtful planning and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/daeeecb24d215415a535bd5dabe5260e.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/daeeecb24d215415a535bd5dabe5260e.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/daeeecb24d215415a535bd5dabe5260e.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can also vertically upgrade cities if you place them in certain patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/de24793031631e0a75eded4504f373c9.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=540 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/de24793031631e0a75eded4504f373c9.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/de24793031631e0a75eded4504f373c9.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Main missions grant new city blueprints upon completion and while failing a main mission ends the current game, side missions are completely optional and offer resource multipliers or bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f49b28d67b5feb555d9d36bae4c42823.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=678 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f49b28d67b5feb555d9d36bae4c42823.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f49b28d67b5feb555d9d36bae4c42823.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use the Shop to Evolve Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Between turns, you gather resources which can be traded in for shop currency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/cf92ba8b7ccff8caa8b34669bf1d8653.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=356 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/cf92ba8b7ccff8caa8b34669bf1d8653.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/cf92ba8b7ccff8caa8b34669bf1d8653.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shop allows you to do the following:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Buy new permanent city blueprints</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Buy one-time-use city blueprints</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Buy refresh if you're unsatisfied with current available choices</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(Selection refreshes every 5 turns for free)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/71784ec65f3a945067c6089d7e58341c.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=358 height=792 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/71784ec65f3a945067c6089d7e58341c.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/71784ec65f3a945067c6089d7e58341c.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shop wisely to unlock stronger city placements and push your score even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive World Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every few turns a different world effect will happen that will bring its own penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/81fb9b3c737b8b52cca4a0afc2b6d2fc.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/81fb9b3c737b8b52cca4a0afc2b6d2fc.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/81fb9b3c737b8b52cca4a0afc2b6d2fc.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make sure to plan ahead for them in order to maximize strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Compete on the global leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While you can finish your run and win by reaching 50k score, you can continue playing in order to compete on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/9d4c4f2817d0a3774346796db7c54fe2.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=500 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/9d4c4f2817d0a3774346796db7c54fe2.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/9d4c4f2817d0a3774346796db7c54fe2.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reach the highest score and put your name on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 unique robotic carriers that offer different resource multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match 3 different resource tiles to unlock and construct city-tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up to 11 distinct city-tiles, each with adjacency bonuses and vertical upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete main missions to keep progressing, or start fresh on failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards from optional side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic shop system that refreshes every 5 turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score-focused gameplay with high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-eco sci-fi aesthetic with glowing hexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve a high score and compete with others on the global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 different world events that give penalties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-progression system to unlock upgrades and features across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cities and mission types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics and visual effects</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683050?t=1755875641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/e249c1c5fa35d0fea094e682a7f5501b55df1605/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755875641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/22daaefa010389f4af6e3ed22d9cfc77d7583799/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755875641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/22daaefa010389f4af6e3ed22d9cfc77d7583799/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755875641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hexalith</strong> is a strategic sci-fi city-builder where you expand a glowing hex-grid colony by placing resource and city tiles. Plan your layout, complete missions, and aim for the highest score where each run offers a new path to optimize and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f1957b105f4c13a28ce5ff940828b39e.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=600 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f1957b105f4c13a28ce5ff940828b39e.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f1957b105f4c13a28ce5ff940828b39e.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start With Choosing Your First City Blueprint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the beginning of every run, you choose one of three carriers and blueprints associated with them, which will help you get started (each carrier has different resource multiplier).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/e2f43161de0e3df7ef3bdf7764c4a700.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/e2f43161de0e3df7ef3bdf7764c4a700.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/e2f43161de0e3df7ef3bdf7764c4a700.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pay attention to the simulation point goal of missions because each blueprint grants different simulation points and costs different amounts of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Place Resources, Build Cities, Complete Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expand your colony using resource tiles, gradually unlocking the ability to place city-tiles. Cities generate Simulation - Sim Points, helping you fulfill main and bonus missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/a2514bdb202f655b7a1bd5bba50ff491.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=480 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/a2514bdb202f655b7a1bd5bba50ff491.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/a2514bdb202f655b7a1bd5bba50ff491.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Smart tile placement matters. There are 11 unique city-tiles currently in the game, but you can hold at most 8 at one point, each with their own adjacency effects that reward thoughtful planning and synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/daeeecb24d215415a535bd5dabe5260e.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/daeeecb24d215415a535bd5dabe5260e.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/daeeecb24d215415a535bd5dabe5260e.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can also vertically upgrade cities if you place them in certain patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/de24793031631e0a75eded4504f373c9.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=540 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/de24793031631e0a75eded4504f373c9.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/de24793031631e0a75eded4504f373c9.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Main missions grant new city blueprints upon completion and while failing a main mission ends the current game, side missions are completely optional and offer resource multipliers or bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f49b28d67b5feb555d9d36bae4c42823.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=678 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f49b28d67b5feb555d9d36bae4c42823.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/f49b28d67b5feb555d9d36bae4c42823.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use the Shop to Evolve Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Between turns, you gather resources which can be traded in for shop currency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/cf92ba8b7ccff8caa8b34669bf1d8653.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=356 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/cf92ba8b7ccff8caa8b34669bf1d8653.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/cf92ba8b7ccff8caa8b34669bf1d8653.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shop allows you to do the following:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Buy new permanent city blueprints</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Buy one-time-use city blueprints</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Buy refresh if you're unsatisfied with current available choices</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(Selection refreshes every 5 turns for free)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/71784ec65f3a945067c6089d7e58341c.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=358 height=792 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/71784ec65f3a945067c6089d7e58341c.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/71784ec65f3a945067c6089d7e58341c.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shop wisely to unlock stronger city placements and push your score even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive World Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every few turns a different world effect will happen that will bring its own penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/81fb9b3c737b8b52cca4a0afc2b6d2fc.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/81fb9b3c737b8b52cca4a0afc2b6d2fc.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/81fb9b3c737b8b52cca4a0afc2b6d2fc.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make sure to plan ahead for them in order to maximize strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Compete on the global leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While you can finish your run and win by reaching 50k score, you can continue playing in order to compete on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/9d4c4f2817d0a3774346796db7c54fe2.poster.avif?t=1755875641\" width=500 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/9d4c4f2817d0a3774346796db7c54fe2.webm?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/extras/9d4c4f2817d0a3774346796db7c54fe2.mp4?t=1755875641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reach the highest score and put your name on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 unique robotic carriers that offer different resource multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match 3 different resource tiles to unlock and construct city-tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up to 11 distinct city-tiles, each with adjacency bonuses and vertical upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete main missions to keep progressing, or start fresh on failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards from optional side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic shop system that refreshes every 5 turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score-focused gameplay with high replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-eco sci-fi aesthetic with glowing hexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve a high score and compete with others on the global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 different world events that give penalties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-progression system to unlock upgrades and features across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cities and mission types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics and visual effects</p></li></ul>","developers":["Artemi Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683050/3ca6de7abfc63d290886017019233462322e9bf8/header.jpg?t=1755875641","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":false,"id":257157470,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157470/movie480.mp4?t=1750493242","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157470/movie_max.mp4?t=1750493242"},"name":"Hexalith - Announcement Trailer [Alpha Version]",